The purpose of this section is to identify those land uses that are prohibited throughout the city limits within all zoning districts for ease of reference and clarity.
1. Accessory Dwellings;
2. Limited Lodging Establishments;
3. Vacation Rental Establishments;
4. Check Cashing, Outlets, Cash Advance Outlets, and Title Loan Establishments;
5. Hookah Lounges;
6. Pawnshops;
7. Teen Clubs;
8. Hair Braiding establishments not included as part of a properly permitted and licensed Hair Salon or Barber Shop;
9. Nightclubs;
10. Tattoo Artistry and/or Parlors;
11. Small Box Discount Stores; and
12. Tire and Rim Shops.
(Ord. No. 2018-13, § 1, 12-3-18; Ord. No. 2019-15, § 2, 9-3-19; Ord. No. 2021-02, § 3, 3-15-21)
